# All other markdown files except AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/, and kitty-specs/
*.md
!MASTER_DOC.md
!architecture-spec.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/**/*.md
!kitty-specs/**/*.md
# Domain/contracts authored by `rust-contract` and proof plan/review/writeup
# artifacts authored by `proof-planner` / `proof-reviewer` / `proof-writer`.
# These are substantive machine-readable specs that go-skill relies on; they
# are not transient review reports.
!clarity-web/src/**/*_contract.md
!proofs/*-plan.md
!proofs/*-review.md
!proofs/*-writeup.md
!proofs/*-repair-guide.md

# Codanna index (binary build artifacts - never commit)
.codanna/index/
.codanna/.project-id
.codannaignore

